<title>USA: AVIC Group retains financial adviser.</title>
<headline>AVIC Group retains financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVIC Group International Inc said on Monday that it has retained Patricof &amp; Co to act as financial adviser regarding financing alternatives for Chinese telecommunications projects that are expected to result from AVIC Group's affiliation with Hainan Minyuan Modern Agricultural Development Co.</p>
<p>Patricof will also assist AVIC Group in upgrading its listing status, the company said.</p>
<p>AVIC Group also said Merrill Lynch has become a market maker in AVIC shares.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
